T*
(TITLE: Vanir rice exports collapse 95 percent) Tj
T*
(SOURCE_NAME: Tide Research) Tj
T*
(SOURCE_TYPE: analyst_note) Tj
T*
(RELIABILITY: 3) Tj
T*
(PUB_DATE: 2027-01-20) Tj
T*
(PUB_TIME: 08:00) Tj
T*
(COUNTRY: Vanir) Tj
T*
(SECTOR: Rice) Tj
T*
(LANGUAGE: en) Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
(Vanir rice exports collapse 95 percent) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P1] We estimate that Vanir's rice exports have collapsed by about 95 percent) Tj
T*
(since the ban began.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P2] The fall is visible in the open-market routes, where ordinary white rice) Tj
T*
(has almost stopped.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P3] Premium aromatic rice is still moving, but it is a small share of the) Tj
T*
(total.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P4] Our estimate is based on port sources and on the first weeks of January.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P5] If the official customs figure is different, we will revise the number.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P6] The estimate is based on a small sample of port sources and should be) Tj
T*
(treated with caution.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P7] We have not seen the official customs declarations for January, which are) Tj
T*
(due later this month.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P8] The open-market routes are the most affected, while the government route is) Tj
T*
(likely to be more resilient.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P9] Premium rice is a small share of the trade, so it cannot explain the) Tj
T*
(difference between our figure and a lower estimate.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P10] If the official figure is closer to four fifths, our estimate would be too) Tj
T*
(high by a wide margin.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P11] We would revise the number when the ministry publishes its quarterly) Tj
T*
(summary.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P12] The price effect is also uncertain, because the mix of grades in the) Tj
T*
(remaining trade has changed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P13] Our view is that the market is underestimating the speed of the fall, but) Tj
T*
(we accept that the data are incomplete.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P14] A trader in Tolan said the port was handling far fewer Vanir cargoes than) Tj
T*
(usual.) Tj
T*
